<title>BELGIUM: Kredietbank opens Philippines unit.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank opens Philippines unit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kredietbank NV, Belgium's fourth largest bank, said on Friday it had set up an off-shore banking unit in the Philippines.</p>
<p>Kredietbank NV Manila will principally finance trade between southeast Asia and the rest of the world and also Asian Development Bank (ADB) projects, Kredietbank said in a statement. The ADB is based in Manila.</p>
<p>Kredietbank said it recently opened a representative office in Jakarta, Indonesia, to add to its existing Asian operations in Hong Kong, Singapore, Taipei, Bangkok and Shanghai.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
